  "attribution": "來源：《焦氏易林》，易學網《焦氏易林［四庫全書版］》（依據版本：《欽定四庫全書》子部術數類），https://www.eee-learning.com/book/giauii 。依來源要求標示出處及原網頁連結；本站僅整理林辭原文，並記錄收錄、標點及文字整理修改。",
  "entryCount": 64,
  "missingTargets": [],
  "entries": [
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 43,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 43,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 43,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 43,
      "hexagramName": "夬",
      "poemText": "戴堯扶禹，松喬彭祖。西遇王母，道路夷易。無敢難者。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:9bc55e8a058ab9a03d07e7e028de327e287c9ea399ae009579bfc224fa7d9eb1",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e2298aeb805d43435f108c9d3eb86a1882344ea191c42394aca3f0fdbcc52bd4"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 43,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 1,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 1,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 1,
      "hexagramName": "乾",
      "poemText": "狼戾美謀，無言不殊。允厭帝心，悅以獲佑。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:94e23a0d69dc7989139a5f77d32c4dda9e80390b3a58285d2c340de808fd8370",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:06a9e46072cef28c33d695cac01050d22754bddbc2e688653a73da6d6d31854f"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 43,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 2,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 2,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 2,
      "hexagramName": "坤",
      "poemText": "歲暮花落，陽入陰室。萬物伏匿，絕不可得。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:ba6eea724b10106a2ae28893f508480d3252c89b4a4552f2ef698b48508a0e4a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:92a6302f2d50cdc6b4dc6bb2364414e897202a7bc74921b2fc87e60779482b3d"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 43,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 3,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 3,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 3,
      "hexagramName": "屯",
      "poemText": "雞鳴失時，君騷於憂。犬吠不休，行者稽留。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:32d616fe854b6a1a8efd656dcba4d3fe7ca650ded8435f7b504abc192cd08b16",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:1a8b2ab1437eb47771da1fef173098815babad2518c568c36f0bc85ff975d455"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 43,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 4,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 4,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 4,
      "hexagramName": "蒙",
      "poemText": "鳧鷖遊涇，君子以寧。履任不愆，福祿來成。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:972eb456aaf486de36998a69dd234b935b8ec12a5d0bb6b3e788bfc4c345c098",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c522a96a36a89b7cb95434a9c2dcbb887ff6a51b71984c2d961a98dae46103dd"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 43,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 5,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 5,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 5,
      "hexagramName": "需",
      "poemText": "薄為蕃皮，勁風吹卻。欲上不得，復歸其宅。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:3ba14554ee2675ea935c40d844169058e37efbb7d2202e90db64015a7ea067d2",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:7033da1d34214f27e634381c99c98e2d586b534d8ab19da6add811dff2f44c50"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 43,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 6,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 6,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 6,
      "hexagramName": "訟",
      "poemText": "東行破車，步入危家。衡門垂倒，無以為主。賣袍續食，糟糠不飽。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:7d945674508ac1218c60bcbf95f23a189057428856d5a9097d68702338315342",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:9d8c6198680fa4573b4f5b8534bc54a6976de6cd8e0a8299736cbddb65755868"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 43,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 7,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 7,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 7,
      "hexagramName": "師",
      "poemText": "青牛白咽，呼我俱田。歷山之下，可以多耕。歲精之節，民人安寧。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:940dcc87c880a617b6b6ba8765fc99bb13e421e223275a4cda9bc3e30c885223",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:18d27857b14b54e70b3ca6233a4e41e755ae321b01fd5d982b8d63e914890435"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 43,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 8,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 8,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 8,
      "hexagramName": "比",
      "poemText": "異國殊俗，情不相得。金木為仇，百賊擅穀。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:8a99d94d6ff1deee66f429f3373ca2b96220ecfaaabec6b6dda7362098517069",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:1fb2bf361a915a1cf93b63231bd464713aed0d21939e2c964aefef37b7d32628"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 43,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 9,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 9,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 9,
      "hexagramName": "小畜",
      "poemText": "陰陽精液，高熟脫折。治卵成鬼，肇生頭目。日有大吉。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:88ff39da152839796a1c71d9e00006c345f9a6f5e7477acd2d27434a5407f4e8",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:9a3dcccc3a5df435000389ef20a257dc0f2e8825699f35c4195976c772965ece"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 43,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 10,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 10,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 10,
      "hexagramName": "履",
      "poemText": "飢蟲作害，多亂纏綿，不可得秋。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:b60749e8b16744606ba7a68ea5d0fe0f1bf199a1e0721952115cf7f5122f7a2a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:0eed6fdd77e78d636cf80ba87a825467e21c54e1560dcd66aee38f27dd4ae29a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 43,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 11,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 11,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 11,
      "hexagramName": "泰",
      "poemText": "清冷如雲，為兵導先。民人寬急，不知東西。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:24178630dc35d63b62f6f54ca6719b3684634fdd17adfd020b5df034eb4b435d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:60a8e27fbafd40bf6a1f90e5b00bbded7da3319747ef2b5aed866c656f9d3e7d"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 43,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 12,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 12,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 12,
      "hexagramName": "否",
      "poemText": "班馬旅師，以息勞疲。役夫嘉喜，入戶見妻。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e9ca5457109c38ea1fdae16281cf5adcc50672a57b91d897267ca1826241f1a7",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a60be370117c198299b8128c95787759ca2b756e6e6d3c363e330c43ab4bfbf9"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 43,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 13,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 13,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 13,
      "hexagramName": "同人",
      "poemText": "坐爭立訟，紛紛哅哅。卒成禍亂，災及家公。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:7eb54b3cbd835de7a59286ee7db2eaa2e8d68c135c6a4e9ba49a2b34e09dfe61",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d317c46a0bd14f41cc524d81dc032d1c1d87b5c28ba50f68303c717446a6fd7c"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 43,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 14,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 14,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 14,
      "hexagramName": "大有",
      "poemText": "鹿食美草，逍遙求飽。趍走山間，過期乃還。肥澤且厭。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:03d3a752fdbae8fb11fc6c64447f9dc88549ab6f18aedad9d71cdce7d182b120",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:792dc62bc85fa8a38452602d2e4ef19e34012dd3d615ba85dbc00702e9f5be75"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 43,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 15,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 15,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 15,
      "hexagramName": "謙",
      "poemText": "田鼠野雉，意尚欲去。拘制籠檻，不得搖動。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:559b3336b4a4ca990265b71a674873ba082d11365cdaa1fa7c1cb316223db148",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:0b205a272d48cd48230cf6de7e53e0402dd936f1c0a7d30ca832b67c87ac493c"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 43,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 16,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 16,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 16,
      "hexagramName": "豫",
      "poemText": "日趍月步，周遍次舍。歷險致遠，無有難處。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:fc2fa9aa0236c8481e4d1f5c5200ebf720f6bea9fff0cf25f8521c928f4fda06",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:7c7b69c116dd65e89011d7b0b1d4beda5d6154defbb913fab99c3152ef86c91f"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 43,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 17,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 17,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 17,
      "hexagramName": "隨",
      "poemText": "天孫帝子，與日月處。光榮於世，福祿祺祉。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:322c8cc3a253862e8fa352d4061db44ee4802a4938c9896ac9939288f51235ac",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:040c45fc52caa5e3849299b5e0d498009aac99b6041a5040a0efbe70418abd76"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 43,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 18,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 18,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 18,
      "hexagramName": "蠱",
      "poemText": "晨風文翰，大舉就溫。時過我邑，羿無所得。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:72d501f34bfa4c1df9bdf5fe97ba284fa74973a7f40f1c83d723f3e55306e0c0",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:8ff81a6ecff607077ab0805939df4151c95500bb3cff13fd2d642663dbbac836"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 43,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 19,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 19,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 19,
      "hexagramName": "臨",
      "poemText": "旦生夕死，名曰嬰鬼，不可潛視。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:de4a7153679d6c1059874162c6bd8c43710099669bc3f880cc915765c988da60",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:776f30c98ed9181f5639ab307a0447922176016cbf97ec2179641e5d6f8b213b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 43,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 20,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 20,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 20,
      "hexagramName": "觀",
      "poemText": "疾貧望幸，使伯南販。開牢擇羊，多得大牂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:79e919f29299002fbf577cac42d8dda050b06410e6df23cbab6fe75aeea73562",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:2e98b685bd54e893fd95feef528b25e07326aea5ee421d5fb67b7cda16b55c9c"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 43,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 21,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 21,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 21,
      "hexagramName": "噬嗑",
      "poemText": "長城驪山，生民大殘。涉井發難，唐叔為患。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:8c174057e67d942402bee07f1672f99bc24a9633a7bcface7f2419b23f36840e",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c0e13b86ab626eda21c98ffd6547ba7ce84f7afa49a922046b99d1a9a1dba08e"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 43,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 22,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 22,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 22,
      "hexagramName": "賁",
      "poemText": "娶於姜呂，駕迎新婦。少齊在門，夫子歡喜。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:029600aadd2b6e2d2816bf47ae6d1429ad4253859ff4c2c503b230652bee8345",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:85d8e46e779ec41579a2dd4a3f5c26be9d865b5757413b4cb61985e48b4eba08"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 43,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 23,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 23,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 23,
      "hexagramName": "剝",
      "poemText": "隨時草木，灌時葉起。扶疏條桃，長大盛美。華沷鑠疏。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:5b4e2039b4417c777e2be3241b1b1eee1ceb25a92b9cb5745c84ba86e0395fe3",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:16e503de9d345060fefcecba1261a9701797415fcc78af29b99a2654c4229e70"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 43,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 24,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 24,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 24,
      "hexagramName": "復",
      "poemText": "姬姜悅歡，二姓為婚。霜降合好，西施在前。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:cdc0327e97a3da753c8bb894154ea281d455fc630d35e86963b9448448dc434f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:0a73b5f147639a89dd45679de3873e39b964f8b210dcb91acee0e747fab30a3a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 43,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 25,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 25,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 25,
      "hexagramName": "无妄",
      "poemText": "戴笠獨宿，晝不見日。勤勞無妄，長勞悲思。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:ba6ac786662b560ba81d3aa55024ee495fa38cbc5387a13b8e7e02be4a14e9c0",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:541e586efe09d86146d69bd6e9d29143df3046ff9be1fd8cb75cb7c24d70cf59"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 43,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 26,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 26,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 26,
      "hexagramName": "大畜",
      "poemText": "始加元服，二十繫室。新婚既樂，伯季有德。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:537b7451ab662d806375762db745c71ab0c31bb3600c3d6b9ae923318a57c134",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:90792d7b919b68738509f67b560c6880aec8b0f087dab48ff1451cdd39a600f0"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 43,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 27,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 27,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 27,
      "hexagramName": "頤",
      "poemText": "二至靈臺，文所止遊。雲物備具，長樂無憂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:18aef52ad2699a17c24433e557f60f99ee5f1293b63b938afc30ad162598073d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:481f44d2bcd12b6f8a3d598272b79fcc2c8121391806b7b5ab20010b668e716f"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 43,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 28,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 28,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 28,
      "hexagramName": "大過",
      "poemText": "久陰霖雨，塗行泥潦。商人休止，市空無有。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:05d86e9bad83218233a8bb9f7a44a35820c7ae25bbe20db345952637d3d15612",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a3fc2fb85ba86e271a47ecd4fb5bba34a34f65f6cd9f7700eceaeaaf5b70f513"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 43,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 29,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 29,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 29,
      "hexagramName": "坎",
      "poemText": "城壞厭境，數為齊病。侵伐不休，君臣擾憂。上下屈竭，士民乏財。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:7dd182bd94842f87012d58c8a3f391f4f71913f933ffb7daa7510a219d6ebf2b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:5a9bec7d577bc4e1713cf6d09a83fb12c6384f46f59821124082e09291641fbe"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 43,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 30,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 30,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 30,
      "hexagramName": "離",
      "poemText": "南國盛茂，黍稷醴酒。可以饗養，樂我嘉祐。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:af7be9faf3e8438764ed239d746d917546774ccc2886653c7b6e7b6b6259e64c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:9b8e6e7dba8b204e937ddca0e17749ace65c29245a0b0c7d02e6a7aa9a99f4ab"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 43,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 31,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 31,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 31,
      "hexagramName": "咸",
      "poemText": "憂在心腹，內崩為疾。禍起蕭牆，意如制國。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:1e459c2c09b7726ae2e75bc69c8fbea4811b1f069f9d6999f73f492c9bdb64b5",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:82438f8ba4c30123ef43e96ccc876493f7564e3adfd030db1ec7dfd84155bce2"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 43,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 32,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 32,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 32,
      "hexagramName": "恒",
      "poemText": "朽根刖樹，花葉落去。卒逢大焱，隨風僵仆。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:6da964fd4f645725832da1abda79c8a3b1748966e42dbb5b999a2451f369cca1",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:38620095cd12aef492da74a073590fff629a00a2041ac40bc70db23e2b15ddef"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 43,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 33,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 33,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 33,
      "hexagramName": "遯",
      "poemText": "樹表為壇，相與笑言。午中不會，寵榮棄袚。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:4f20b02631e46dbf4413bc516fc0464773faa49126e63546c5bda9f9600940d1",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:77c6f1c63faa01e9f6754c66cf379d0bcd0124576b61c55bcd749e87f1cbb901"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 43,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 34,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 34,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 34,
      "hexagramName": "大壯",
      "poemText": "四足俱走，駑疲任後。兩戰不勝，敗於東楚。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:7645f15565b53371a540ecdfe8644dd9c91929e42fae2ef836f5bcd81d40cad0",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b6eb8e99463c6ad61437c1d812456506639db2646432e9cc0fbace45036250b0"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 43,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 35,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 35,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 35,
      "hexagramName": "晉",
      "poemText": "執轡在朝，回還故處。麥秀傷心，叔父無憂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:878477dc83153d71ef38df9cebcbd3141101c1c9328a2cc0807bd513331bbde5",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:231a562d7191ff13ab3eedae5b9f747fa4a396c2325da8b3b766280bf2b7bf2f"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 43,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 36,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 36,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 36,
      "hexagramName": "明夷",
      "poemText": "夜長日短，陰為陽賊。萬物空枯，藏於北陸。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:3def0182b9cd6442dae767f018567f97fd1a743087e510faa532cab61312e047",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:0d6d5fd435a26ca2d02b59e3c28017875799e61ff482c41df5131798643936fd"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 43,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 37,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 37,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 37,
      "hexagramName": "家人",
      "poemText": "鳴鳩七子，均而不殆。長大成就，棄合於好。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:007858a039597005ac98d7d0b5fe324806beb20707c9ebbc10fda269b78cb824",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c9bf8e8134d687da1eeb1db43161e294f49ffead79a391615152b45554e11122"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 43,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 38,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 38,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 38,
      "hexagramName": "睽",
      "poemText": "三羊上山，馳至大原。黃龍負舟，逐到夷陽。宛其玉囊。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:1e06338467cfdb92b81d828b1262ce26cdcea28219d3381ad875367349a299e0",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a7e4464efe00dd86a5528b863e50c851c4c24fb857b1848cb8f1fddeb478aa11"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 43,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 39,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 39,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 39,
      "hexagramName": "蹇",
      "poemText": "首足易處，頭尾顛倒。公為雌嫗，亂其蠶織。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d79288ef4e8933a8129f85204044491f7af4a02f197d891d25475e0eedbd5ca4",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:fd43922b23e55fabdbd2ea26c6b8ca04a11c234c3eab0a6da899e15528251dc6"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 43,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 40,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 40,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 40,
      "hexagramName": "解",
      "poemText": "登高望家，役事未休。王事靡盬，不得逍遙。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:1b3b91da803c2499e2be287005a52bd64e9857d38e51680ce9ad167620b344b7",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:90e2f8e6b4b9ed07860e11cd50e938b2a1317ace25af6dfb3eeeb0e630cd8834"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 43,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 41,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 41,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 41,
      "hexagramName": "損",
      "poemText": "畏昏不行，候旦待明。燎獵受福，老賴其慶。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:1cc7cc83f231572fb027b90854870cf2f1a783afcb4fc3c854b2165dd7e3d70e",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:01cbabf403d6a5fce399c8765b8984e0e6eb5cd2f87f96af90bc3132cae3ebd5"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 43,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 42,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 42,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 42,
      "hexagramName": "益",
      "poemText": "孤獨特處，莫依無輔，心勞志苦。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:9c394d3a09020ac3807a9ec357587bebf6c329ae01ad0bc889031b539fc7860f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e6e6c0f7a6b49f320fc8060d75a0711cb1794d2c3555ac445f4f59a257b965ad"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 43,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 44,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 44,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 44,
      "hexagramName": "姤",
      "poemText": "山石朽破，消崩墜墮。上下離心，君受其祟。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c664d5d5a87f7cf944c4df1e3c12af6f2bb149b4b1e0ce56f916dd162a91cfc4",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:41a8344bfd6d5b5c50db1c94655f5c98cfd696c879b7add7ae1f4f4d84fe164e"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 43,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 45,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 45,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 45,
      "hexagramName": "萃",
      "poemText": "文母聖子，無疆壽考，為天下主。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:1fe5f9569bf2e91ca70f6d0525a1eb2782cf7a168768b91ab18e730bb39b7f14",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:bf31a1f4b8c228c59b08f75918145376dbe39a8e8adb6f5179ca93bcc0f7b363"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 43,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 46,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 46,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 46,
      "hexagramName": "升",
      "poemText": "倔傀如儀，前後相違。言如鱉咳，語不可知。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:abfb70c7a17954984dcaddd203641e19361140aaab0161a2e346cb167c8933b2",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:279abe569059ca4054400d59ac8a9e0b866ff4e7ee4228675f312992e2617c62"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 43,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 47,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 47,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 47,
      "hexagramName": "困",
      "poemText": "五龍俱起，強者敗走。露我苗稼，年歲大有。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:cac803805077ed20b2973c7fc94cefc25471981ce47844fd3adbe6900a42e98c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:be402ee7d830478421df9a63254ca62f2cabbc6834c9b59b1c171c55904b4ada"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 43,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 48,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 48,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 48,
      "hexagramName": "井",
      "poemText": "雷除善猛，雖為功醫。驥疲鹽車，出於御箠。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f0797fc99f3f3cf0199047a23f6b9bcbb5d8b78fb838e24575606a372b20092c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b87575f1429f46b05c449e9e55cb7e9431d59af7b1bb5d55aaea8511e11035ae"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 43,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 49,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 49,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 49,
      "hexagramName": "革",
      "poemText": "江南多蝮，螫我手足。冤煩詰屈，痛徹心腹。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:a81dfcfb0b0b9b6de62ca3edc60f30c16ab8f28b4e19156b5b20d1fb8671e2ea",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e8fa9e8d3e55dc8fe5d471b44f193a7785e479e234e8354cb40d26fd5fc2f740"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 43,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 50,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 50,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 50,
      "hexagramName": "鼎",
      "poemText": "心無可據，射鹿不得。多言少實，語無成事。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:0b528333d6ec982942ef8e78edd402b81acac87a7c6fdac42b832f2a36f0bea7",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f19e2ef05d6757c3bea2f0e8133632750618b45ec135183f428f7e52c8abe894"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 43,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 51,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 51,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 51,
      "hexagramName": "震",
      "poemText": "君明臣賢，鳴求其友。顯德之政，可以履土。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:9caa8f9966531a5a6a499c30e788e38bdb6701a7b7db7cbf780fdf678b6eadea",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:7ac955b68d2bdfccc4d2502f497b37bcd003c6c4094e82d0c7fe0c08e9cb13f1"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 43,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 52,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 52,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 52,
      "hexagramName": "艮",
      "poemText": "安土宜官，一日九遷。踰越群等，牧養常山。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:68d7dd3a87f41b3fdac2ecac1ba102fa039ba468377699be5f7a1568c3cf22e1",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:16f32b9da92ee897a50f1f1622e3a7eff78678d4c448d7040b4a33843d44508c"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 43,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 53,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 53,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 53,
      "hexagramName": "漸",
      "poemText": "保辭解謝，除去垢活。驚之成患，屢去酷殘。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:00754e2e709ad86d062e8c439dda122da3e495aaceaa49b3f298afc015057da1",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e91bf90df8415b46f61d59308e4d3405ba2428963accfba9232a6c859c2854a4"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 43,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 54,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 54,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 54,
      "hexagramName": "歸妹",
      "poemText": "不狂嫗盲，相牽北行。欲歸高邑，迷惑公得。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:0567941c7711e6e7624478b8b4127fb3e180da6d5f6ec89cb84b50f6e5a5a4ee",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:65c5adc229bf00c2ac5d5127d19e49ea02a0d88557998e4562f2ee1c125c22c5"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 43,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 55,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 55,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 55,
      "hexagramName": "豐",
      "poemText": "醉臥道傍，迷且失明，不合我生。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:ec8d1885b025568ec0112b633397eebc184d1c63d40bd09f3d4a12d5803b0b1e",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:067f943b4788c72e2c4800c0e053e6fb213dea1705de481688d1a2aa48fe674a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 43,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 56,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 56,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 56,
      "hexagramName": "旅",
      "poemText": "北登鬼丘，駕龍東遊。王母御后，文武何憂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:59e06630231ec286284cf77563de51d4765e8bddd6cf832322a44dd1ad3e5668",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:18966a1ed66a92ce12263288841597622d1ab06d9918af304fe9ce4ef9a641f6"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 43,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 57,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 57,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 57,
      "hexagramName": "巽",
      "poemText": "恬淡無患，遊戲道門。與神來往，長出以安。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f5928e0547f9fa7c7dcec767cecdd299cbd58a6723d380395c40dad7928c24e8",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c074f0a6c4bdbe49c74f26b67f8795db35a8fb8c1d00d772c2dc18d27ae0b4ee"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 43,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 58,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 58,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 58,
      "hexagramName": "兌",
      "poemText": "以緡易絲，抱布自媒。棄禮怠惰，卒罹悔憂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:94df91d7ecfe7b9b41d18a164425f44d87f5dae0a32c02e9cc5cd6fe8850c238",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:04be68abbef6bff0031656582d8f5da17d99cd89961d72b481b0ec76c0ca0ad4"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 43,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 59,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 59,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 59,
      "hexagramName": "渙",
      "poemText": "被服衣冠，游戲道門。以禮相終，身無災患。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:9df74f036e4891cf40d3714e0fef772d847d46a27e8c578e1c352822b87ce67b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:1a3831970412d38397e2e714f4f0f3403f1bdaa74b000c2feaaf38b412afed0f"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 43,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 60,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 60,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 60,
      "hexagramName": "節",
      "poemText": "大麓魚池，陸為海涯。君子失行，小人相攜。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:89264db67b16bb688ac796bcda756e69d2c35386389c321a92af1ba1c27f480a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:9a4befb9a30358a51949ae6c4e71718392c1cd417bd7bb52f88428ea95067e9b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 43,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 61,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 61,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 61,
      "hexagramName": "中孚",
      "poemText": "淵泉溢出，為邑之祟。道路不通，孩子心憒。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:642e3dc0aa46f5059449a58bfc18240cf874ee55b9b7062657f697f4ab80465e",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:733fc213dff8267c1c48a047c13910d27f8a4d794098d89d37c60c0c0bb4aae9"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 43,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 62,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 62,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 62,
      "hexagramName": "小過",
      "poemText": "十里望煙，散渙四方。形體滅亡，可入深淵。終不見君。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:57a40fe1b080c26c781620b12512b6998d044906850a3c9c2930a3e984ef3f4b",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:957029673b7bc970135adedb5d5f9b9347b4f294d8ad3573ad2b378b7316b8a2"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 43,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 63,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 63,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 63,
      "hexagramName": "既濟",
      "poemText": "傳言相談，非好徑路。鳴鼓逐狼，不知跡處。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:9a6854054cda140f5e3216834ac724a03b8a97ed1cf445303dd21aacad6baf76",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:450ed9a92fb1f86feb82d0c00e2eb6162beaaeb45212c21121f5f0c5f4abec2a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 43,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 64,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 64,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 64,
      "hexagramName": "未濟",
      "poemText": "東失大珠，西行棄襦。時多不利，使我後起。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:58d6e18fe2f2b216e1112e3b8f0ce0402d0724b22ebbbf1d284bd8a80a06fc5a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:de4602a92963e50327a3cf80bb39c177105b80334fe58dc0b44ebea77c94dd03"
    }
  ]
}
